{"skill":{"slug":"jotform","displayName":"JotForm"},"version":{"version":"1.2.9","createdAt":1790938442379,"changelog":"Simplify the login instructions to the code flow (maton login prints a link; finish with maton login --code <CODE>), drop the API Key subsection, and pin the Maton CLI install to 0.4.0.","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":51005,"sha256":"ea779e3f67d9d67cca5b290e4ddd830ca47e58dc112217a413e760096b16e496","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/calendly/triggers.md","size":10281,"sha256":"ae92dbfb6dd4caf628900b293d1b3c6e7d5e70cf7f6a9397407594daf50d4a48","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/github/triggers.md","size":61142,"sha256":"7424d3be38ec400eb8a4b0a6a94a94eeec40208c0bcee29a61caa5da48eea7f4","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/google-mail/triggers.md","size":2648,"sha256":"5cc5065cd7db33dc33715675bbb0ee29ed49657ad9ad4354aebd1a9efdf8d8f3","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/hubspot/triggers.md","size":8298,"sha256":"439d56e4d02e119e1de3caf79a0334243ae70c583a3e15847831c396f39c2837","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/linear/triggers.md","size":7270,"sha256":"641f6496f50e09faab921ef4c06f725122b798cb034e9f0dfaf9f838074ab377","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/notion/triggers.md","size":5840,"sha256":"fdaf3840d8213dbd7549426c1166f94cc94b09e022a1611ef2dad6f36db2f969","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/slack/triggers.md","size":6181,"sha256":"b5ee099a215223a7e5186c41a0d13fc1de68e977719304c509df105843d81f38","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/stripe/triggers.md","size":25651,"sha256":"ae091545396a376c7ecfe09e94b46b7bbb44fd8a72ea954bcc1239052b7959f0","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/time/triggers.md","size":1140,"sha256":"b8f5a523501f8d03e11e58f6426cd96b54ba0c66c8983b57c0ea31386b309e01","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2183,"sha256":"1e499b300df4d700df2e2819bca857b1908d3c20f6ad4467339f6d61caca343c","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1790938850593,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"9eaacad43125e317a8290a2a6130cb48734df30b6b99731a14f7a7d3a43ce41d","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/9eaacad43125e317a8290a2a6130cb48734df30b6b99731a14f7a7d3a43ce41d","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1790938610446},"skillspector":{"status":"clean","normalizedStatus":"clean","score":0,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":0,"checkedAt":1790938850593},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This is a disclosed JotForm integration that can access and modify form data through Maton, with clear approval rules for writes, webhooks, and automation.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Requested Bash, Read, Grep, and Glob plus network access are proportionate to invoking a CLI-based API gateway. The raw HTTP/API-key fallback is limited to environments where the CLI cannot be installed and includes secret-handling warnings.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"Installation uses pinned Maton CLI/SDK versions via npm, Homebrew, pip, or npm SDK. This is purpose-aligned for an API integration, though users are trusting the Maton toolchain and account connection.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"note"},{"detail":"Runtime instructions default to read/list operations, require explicit user approval for connection creation and all POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE actions, and warn that external API content and trigger payloads are untrusted data.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"OAuth credentials, webhooks, hosted functions, triggers, destinations, and watch checkpoints can persist beyond one run. The artifact discloses this and adds approval, least-privilege, deletion, and destination-scope guidance, so no hidden persistence was found.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The skill's capabilities match its stated purpose: JotForm OAuth access, form/submission reads, form and submission writes, webhook management, and optional Maton-hosted functions/triggers. These can affect business data, but the artifact repeatedly scopes them to the user's connected JotForm account and documented endpoints.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"note"}],"guidance":"Install only if you intend to let Maton connect to your JotForm account. Review any write, deletion, webhook, trigger, destination, or hosted-function action before approving it, because those can change form data or create ongoing forwarding of future submissions.","findings":null,"agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1790938850593}}}}}